  RV5StageFloatRegisterControl
  RV5StageFloatExecutionControl
  RV5StageFloatingPointControl
  SingleExecutionCases
  RV64SingleExecutionCases
  DoubleExecutionCases
  RV64DoubleExecutionCases
  compose_floating_point_control_cases
  RV32FFloatingPointInstructions
  RV64FFloatingPointInstructions
  RV32FDFloatingPointInstructions
  RV64FDFloatingPointInstructions
  RV32FFloatingPointControlCases
  RV64FFloatingPointControlCases
  RV32FDFloatingPointControlCases
  RV64FDFloatingPointControlCases
  RV32FFloatingPointDecode
  RV64FFloatingPointDecode
  RV32FDFloatingPointDecode
  RV64FDFloatingPointDecode
  RV5StageFloatingPointInstructionDecoder
